Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:21:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] OB-5: One Brain capability CONNECT

One capability read path projected from existing registries and owner
recognizers (no new catalog/router/vocabulary); one capability selection
per turn after the OB-3/OB-4 bindings, reading Boundary meaning through the
gate; handoffs through owners' existing entry points on the one pending
record; returns as projections over owners' own records.

Connections: chat -> Claire (context + confirmed-write return + receipt),
Board result -> chat (Board Room opened for chat intakes, return + one armed
next action), Board -> Research -> Board, chat -> Projects (next-step engine
answer + Project Home). Model prompt gets the same capability projection;
fabricated-research instructions replaced with honest ones.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
